---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import teamPhoto from '../assets/team/paola-manuel.jpg';
---

<section id="about-us">
    <div class="wrap story-grid">
        <div class="story-media reveal">
            <figure class="frame-img">
                <Image class="pic" src={teamPhoto} alt="Paola and Manuel, founders of Happy Clicks" width={900} format="webp" />
                <figcaption class="plabel">Paola &amp; Manuel</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy story-copy reveal">
            <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
            <h2 style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.6vw,3.4rem);margin-top:1rem">
                Happy Clicks started with our own <span class="it gold">love story</span>.
            </h2>
            <p>
                We’re high school sweethearts who have grown through many seasons of life together, and in 2023, we
                celebrated one of our biggest milestones: our wedding. While planning our big day, we knew we wanted a
                photo booth, but we had a very specific vision. We wanted something elevated, with beautiful,
                professional quality photos and an experience our guests would genuinely enjoy.
            </p>
            <p>After our wedding, we kept coming back to one idea:</p>
            <p class="story-quote">What if we created the photo booth experience we had been looking for ourselves?</p>
            <p>And that’s how Happy Clicks was born.</p>
            <p>
                To us, Happy Clicks has never been just about taking pictures. We’re in the business of entertainment,
                connection, and memories. A photo booth is an icebreaker, a place where friends, family, coworkers, and
                even strangers can come together, be silly, laugh, and create memories.
            </p>
            <p>
                From weddings and graduations to corporate events and celebrations of every kind, our goal is always
                the same: create an inviting experience, deliver beautiful photos worth keeping and sharing, and make
                sure people have fun.
            </p>
            <p>
                Happy Clicks is something we’ve built together with so much love, and we bring that same care into
                every event and every client we work with. We know we’re not just showing up with a photo booth. We’re
                being trusted with a small part of someone’s special day, and we truly love being part of it.
            </p>
            <p class="sig">— Paola &amp; Manuel</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
